  "description": "The Speed Queen is here. The product of a two-year redesign, using the newest computer design and refined in the wind tunnel, Fuji has given women one bike that has it all. Want speed? Tested over 40 kilometers at 25 mph, it's more than 3 minutes faster than the previous Supreme. Want light weight? The 1.1 model is less than 15 pounds. Want comfort? The new frame has dropped, thinner seat stays for more forgiveness over rough roads. Want better stopping power? It's a frame designed solely for disc brakes. It's the new Fuji standard. And it's built for women.",
